<title>USA: Volkswagen Golf K2 priced at $14,275.</title>
<headline>Volkswagen Golf K2 priced at $14,275.</headline>
<dateline>AUBURN HILSL, Mich. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Volkswagen of America Inc, a unit of Volkswagen AG, said it introduced an alpine version of its Golf model, the Golf K2, at a suggested manufacturers retail price of $14,275.</p>
<p>The vehicle will have with either skis or a snowboard as standard equipment.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
